tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fuente: SERNAGEOMIN – 09:30 horas (17/06/2024).</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify\"><strong>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong><strong>ALERTAS VIGENTES</strong></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Tipo Alerta</span></strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Cobertura</span></strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Evento </span></strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Inicio</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Roja</span></strong></p></td><td><p><span style=\"color:black\">Comuna de Arauco, Región del Biobío.</span></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:7.3pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Desborde.</span></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:.3pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:black\">17-06-2024</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Roja</span></strong></p></td><td><p><span style=\"color:black\">Región del Biobío.</span></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:7.3pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Evento meteorológico.</span></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:.3pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:black\">11-06-2024</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Roja</span></strong></p></td><td><p><span style=\"color:black\">Provincia de Malleco, Región de La   Araucanía.</span></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:7.3pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Desborde.</span></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:.3pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:black\">13-06-2024</span></p></td